      "writtenOn": "2024-10-09T16:26:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "nit: Maybe we could create the cache on device creation, and just have this be `GetGlobalPipelineCache`? Then each pipeline would call `PipelineCache::Create` if needed. Overall it seems that our hierarchy of classes for caches is both too abstract, or not finished enough.",
      "revId": "801395426cf81aab67050db88e23d4d99b03eed5",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "8da6ea74_8988290d",
        "filename": "src/dawn/native/vulkan/DeviceVk.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 5
      },
      "lineNbr": 236,
      "author": {
        "id": 1004831
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-10-10T18:13:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s actually sort of beneficial to leave the pipeline cache creation as late as possible. That gives more time data in disk cache to be loaded into BlobCache on startup. Let me know if there is something you want me to change here though.",
      "parentUuid": "18f98325_7f60c4b7",
      "revId": "801395426cf81aab67050db88e23d4d99b03eed5",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
