      "writtenOn": "2024-10-09T20:03:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Should start with `Device::GetCacheKey` because that includes everything here already plus the isolation key that is required, then maybe add ` deviceProperties.pipelineCacheUUID` which I don\u0027t think is included.\n\nIn fact, I think we should probably just include the `deviceProperties.pipelineCacheUUID` in the Vulkan device cache key. Probably would require moving this field https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/src/dawn/native/Device.h;l\u003d611;bpv\u003d1;bpt\u003d1 into the `protected` and then doing something like:\n\n```\nvulkan::Device::Initialize {\n  ...\n  StreamIn(\u0026mDeviceCacheKey, deviceProperties.pipelineCacheUUID)\n  ...\n}\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 240,
        "startChar": 12,
        "endLine": 240,
        "endChar": 30
      },
      "revId": "801395426cf81aab67050db88e23d4d99b03eed5",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
