      "writtenOn": "2024-10-10T18:13:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I changed this to be based on Device::GetCacheKey().\n\nI think WGSL-\u003eSPRIV caches use Device::GetCacheKey() based on code search. If so, those cache entries are not invalidated if pipelineCacheUUID changes so we shouldn\u0027t include it in the device key.",
      "parentUuid": "1521a6c8_ad817343",
      "range": {
